{"id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-inductive-def.md","title":"归纳定义","display":"df-inductive-def — 归纳定义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-inductive-def","aliases":["29-df-inductive-def"],"display":"df-inductive-def — 归纳定义","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-structure]]"],"source_locator":"§4.1, pp.57–58, DjVu scans 72–73","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-inductive-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-inductive-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive-def — 归纳定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§4.1, pp.57–58, DjVu scans 72–73"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个不同变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|A|^k\">\\(X\\subseteq|A|^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[R:=X]\">\\(A[R:=X]\\)</span> 是仅增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 解释的结构扩张；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\">\\(\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\">\\(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\\)</span>。算子及各阶段的指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,\\bar x\">\\(R,\\bar x\\)</span> 是定义数据的一部分。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}:\\mathcal P(|A|^k)\\to\\mathcal P(|A|^k),\\qquad F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=X]\\models\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}:\\mathcal P(|A|^k)\\to\\mathcal P(|A|^k),\\qquad F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=X]\\models\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_0^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad R_{i+1}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_0^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad R_{i+1}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §4.1，印刷页 57–58，扫描页 72–73。此接口用于没有额外自由个体参数的 FO 定义；带参数和嵌套算子的完整语义由相应逻辑原子显式给出。这里不先假设单调性，因此同一迭代接口可用于 PFP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar x$ 为 $k$ 个不同变量；$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}}$ 且 $\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)$，见 [[29-df-formula]] 与 [[29-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar x$ 为 $k$ 个不同变量；$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}}$ 且 $\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)$，见 [[29-df-formula]] 与 [[29-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisf